  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nOnce per turn, when an opponent's monster declares
    an attack: You can make that opponent's monster lose 300 ATK for each face-up
    Pendulum Monster in your Extra Deck.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nIf this card is
    Normal or Special Summoned: You can send 1 \"Performapal\" or \"Odd-Eyes\" monster
    from your Deck to the GY, except \"Performapal Odd-Eyes Valet\", and if you do,
    this card's Level becomes the same as that monster's, until the end of this turn.
    You can only use this effect of \"Performapal Odd-Eyes Valet\" once per turn.
    If this card in the Monster Zone is destroyed: You can place this card in your
    Pendulum Zone."
